  "description": "This dataset comprises neurophysiological recordings collected during visual and audiovisual stimulation in a virtual reality environment recreating the Edzna archaeological site. The study captures brain activity responses to multimodal sensory inputs in an immersive archaeological context, providing a resource for investigating neural processing of integrated visual and auditory information in virtual environments.",
